             Renesas LTS Kernel

2024/12		Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
=============================================

* About Renesas LTS Kernel

	"Renesas LTS" = "Linux LTS" + "Backport from latest Linux Kernel for Renesas".

	We will try to backport Renesas related patch from latest Linux Kernel as much as
	possible, but no guarantee, because backport will be very difficult if it depends
	on Framework, etc.

* URL

	You can get Renesas LTS Kernel by

		> git clone https://github.com/renesas-rcar/upstream_bsp.git

* Branch

	We have 2 type of Renesas LTS Kernels branchs

	branch
		(A) renesas-lts/v6.12-dev
		(B) renesas-lts/v6.12.xxx-yyyy-mm-dd

	(A) is using "git merge". Pros is you can use "git merge" for it. Cons is it is difficult
	to know what kind of patch was backported from upstream.

	(B) is using "git rebase". Pros is it is easy to know what kind of patch was backported from
	upstream. Cons is you need to use "git rebase" for it, can't use "git merge" when update.

	Latest (B) and (A) will have no diff.

	[Note]
	We will keep total 10 versions for each (B).
	Be care if you *not* update frequently. See below "Tag"

* Tag

	We have 2 type of Renesas LTS Kernels Tags

	tag
		(A) renesas-dev-v6.12.xxx
		(B) renesas-lts-v6.12.xxx
		            ^^^

	The feature of (A)/(B) are same as "Branch". See above.
	These tags are added when the last version digit was 0 or 5.
	If you *not* update frequently, we recommend to use "Tag", instead of "Branch".

	[Note]
	You can't check/fetch above tag by normal ways.  You need to do...

		> git ls-remote --tags renesas-rcar
		> git fetch renesas-rcar refs/tags/renesas-xxx-v6.1.xxx

* renesas_defconfig

	You can find "renesas_defconfig" for Renesas SoC/Board which removed
	unnecessary configs from "defconfig".

* CVE info

	You can find CVE info at

		linux/renesas-lts/cve-all
		linux/renesas-lts/cve-affected
		linux/renesas-lts/cve-no-affect

* Backported commit

	You can find what commits were backported from latest Linux Kernel at

		linux/renesas-lts/list

* Backport request

	Please let me know if you find missing backport.

	Kuninori Morimoto <kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
